  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding from IIC will help Caja de Compensaci&#xf3;n Familiar de Antioquia (Comfama, a Colombian family social fund) meet the requirements of Law 789 enacted in 2002. The law requires that family social funds create more jobs by providing funding directly to small and medium-size companies. Comfama will use this line of credit to grant working capital loans for micro-enterprises and small and medium-size companies affiliated with Comfama.</narrative>
  </description>
